From 7b44ff5c11a2d504f6eafa874d54d85142ae1fc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:24:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Use the Schedule forecast in the store overview and save the
 store payroll target

The weekly sales box on the store overview now edits the same forecast the
Schedule screen uses, so a change on either screen shows on the other. Each
day keeps its share from the day weights in Settings.

The store payroll target is saved on the store, so the overview can show
whether total scheduled payroll is over or under it. Migration
010_store_payroll.sql adds the column.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dbibe2AFHP4aR2mKEVHoEr
